---
import { catalog } from "../lib/catalog.js";
import { formatVerified } from "../lib/format.js";

const verified = formatVerified(catalog.meta.verifiedAt);
---

<div class="notice">
  <p class="data-note-label">Data-quality note</p>
  <p>
    The name is the company on NHTSA's plant-code record. The record does not list tire brands, and this site does not claim a plant makes a given brand.
    Which company filed a tire recall is a separate file: <a href="/who-makes-it/">Who makes it?</a>
    NHTSA status field; may be out of date. Active is not a finding that the company or the plant is operating.
    Data last verified {verified} (UTC). <a href="/methodology/known-errors/#plants">Known errors</a>. <a href="/methodology/#data-quality">Data-quality notes</a>.
  </p>
</div>
